 runtime change capture, failure isolation, and the mapped capture tests. Keep scope to the listed implementation targets and verify with the story gate when ready.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"Next planner turn should evaluate the implementor artifact against TC-2.1 through TC-2.9 plus idempotency and atomicity risk tests before choosing review or verify.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:7:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-verify\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Implementation reports ready-for-verification with story gate, green gate, and epic gate passing, but no verifier result exists yet. Verification is the smallest safe next action before any acceptance recommendation.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"artifactRefs\\\":[\\\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/003-implementor.json\\\"],\\\"focus\\\":\\\"Verify Story 2 against TC-2.1 through TC-2.9 plus the idempotency and atomicity risk tests. Pay specific attention to implementor-surfaced limitations: synthesized source-event index as idempotency entry id, unknown top-level message role handling, abort disposition carried via runtime_note, unsupported content parts degraded to runtime_note, and map/accumulate orchestration in index.ts.\\\",\\\"provider\\\":\\\"codex\\\"}}\"}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:11:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-continue\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Latest verifier outcome is revise with one critical blocking finding, SV-001. The smallest safe next action is to return to the existing story implementor continuation to fix the resume/reload idempotency collision and add coverage for the missing TC-2.7 path.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"continuationRef\\\":\\\"storyImplementor\\\",\\\"promptAddendum\\\":\\\"Address verifier finding SV-001 from /Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/004-verify.json. Fix existing-thread resume/reload so new finalized events cannot collide with prior idempotency keys when captureSession.sourceSeq restarts. Add objective tests proving: (1) after recording an event, a fresh connector attached to the same existing thread records a new message instead of skipping it as a duplicate; (2) reload behaves the same; (3) normal resume does not re-fire historical messages while still recording new messages; (4) the fix preserves duplicate-safe replay/re-delivery behavior. Keep the fix inside Story 2 scope and rerun the configured gates: pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify -- test/capture, pnpm --filter pi-lhc green-verify, and pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify-all.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"Next planner turn should verify SV-001 is fixed with explicit existing-thread resume/reload coverage before accepting or re-running verifier.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:15:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-implement\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Impl-lead reopened the story after the failed continue finalize and explicitly requested a fresh implementor pass. SV-001 remains blocking, so the smallest safe next action is a new implementor run that preserves the on-disk Story 2 work and fixes existing-thread resume/reload capture loss with explicit tests.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"promptAddendum\\\":\\\"Fresh implementor pass required. Do not run story-continue or resume the prior claude-code implementor session. Rehydrate