e last durable recovery boundary.\",\"currentPhase\":\"terminal\",\"currentChildOperation\":{\"command\":\"story-implement\",\"artifactPath\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/007-implementor.json\"},\"latestArtifacts\":[{\"kind\":\"validation-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/001-story-validate.json\",\"provenance\":\"prior-run\"},{\"kind\":\"implementor-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/003-implementor.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"verifier-result\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/004-verify.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"final-package\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/001-final-package.json\",\"provenance\":\"current-run\"},{\"kind\":\"review-request\",\"path\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/001-review-request-001.json\",\"provenance\":\"caller-input\"}],\"latestContinuationHandles\":{\"storyImplementor\":{\"provider\":\"claude-code\",\"sessionId\":\"4562dd99-e915-4997-a6b6-c06f59211979\",\"storyId\":\"02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation\"},\"storyVerifier\":{\"provider\":\"codex\",\"sessionId\":\"019ec517-957e-7520-99ad-8c58c7c12cc1\",\"storyId\":\"02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation\"}},\"latestEventSequence\":20,\"callerInputHistory\":{\"reviewRequests\":[{\"source\":\"impl-lead (Claude Code orchestrator)\",\"decision\":\"reopen\",\"summary\":\"story-continue 005 FAILED at finalize with PROVIDER_OUTPUT_INVALID (~1MB streaming output the runtime could not parse into a result envelope) — a recurring claude-code large-continue/session-resume finalize flakiness (NOT a code problem; edits are applied live to disk). Do NOT run-continue. Start a FRESH implementor pass (run-implement, new session) that re-hydrates from the on-disk Story 2 capture code — already substantial and present: src/capture/{converter,map-message,turn-accumulator,idempotency,runtime-changes}.ts, src/index.ts hook wiring, and test/capture/* — and resolves the one open verifier finding below, then proceed to verify. Build on the on-disk code; do not discard it. Fresh implements finalize reliably here; continues do not.\",\"items\":[{\"id\":\"SV-001\",\"severity\":\"blocker\",\"concern\":\"Existing-thread resume/reload can silently skip new finalized events (verifier 004, critical). On resume/reload of an existing thread, newly finalized PI message_end events may be dropped from capture — a silent capture gap.\",\"requiredResponse\":\"Fix the existing-thread resume/reload intake path so newly finalized PI events are captured and never silently skipped. Honor the no-silent-failure invariant (AC-2.7) and ensure idempotency dedup (AC-2.6) does not over-skip genuinely new events on resume/reload. Preserve the existing converter, turn-derivation (one LHC turn per exchange, closed at agent_end), parallel-tool correlation, error/abort capture, and runtime-note capture. Add/keep a test that proves resume/reload after new events captures them.\",\"evidence\":[\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/004-verify.json\"]}],\"evidence\":[\"docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/004-verify.json\"]}],\"rulings\":[]},\"nextIntent\":{\"actionType\":\"replay-smallest-safe-step\",\"summary\":\"Use story-orchestrate resume after correcting the child operation failure; replay should start from the last safe story-run checkpoint.\",\"artifactRef\":\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/001-final-package.json\"},\"replayBoundary\":{\"smallestSafeStep\":\"resume-current-attempt\",\"reasoning\":\"The attempt was interrupted and recorded a terminal recovery package, so the safest replay point is the current durable story-run snapshot.\",\"validArtifactPaths\":[\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/001-story-validate.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/003-implementor.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/004-verify.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/001-final-package.json\",\"/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/001-review-request-001.json\"],\"requiresFreshStoryLeadSession\":false,\"requiresFreshChildProviderSession\":false},\"updatedAt\":\"2026-06-14T08:20:39.078Z\"}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/streams/001-story-lead.stdout.log:15:{\"type\":\"item.completed\",\"item\":{\"id\":\"item_0\",\"type\":\"agent_message\",\"text\":\"{\\\"action\\\":\\\"run-implement\\\",\\\"rationale\\\":\\\"Impl-lead reopened the story after the failed continue finalize and explicitly requested a fresh implementor pass. SV-001 remains blocking, so the smallest safe next action is a new implementor run that preserves the on-disk Story 2 work and fixes existing-thread resume/reload capture loss with explicit tests.\\\",\\\"inputs\\\":{\\\"promptAddendum\\\":\\\"Fresh implementor pass required. Do not run story-continue or resume the prior claude-code implementor session. Rehydrate from the on-disk Story 2 capture implementation and tests already present in packages/pi-lhc/src/capture/{converter,map-message,turn-accumulator,idempotency,runtime-changes}.ts, packages/pi-lhc/src/index.ts, and packages/pi-lhc/test/capture/*. Resolve verifier finding SV-001 from 004-verify.json: existing-thread resume/reload currently resets synthesized entry ids/sourceSeq to s0, causing new finalized PI events on an existing thread to collide with prior idempotency keys and be silently skipped. Fix the production intake path so new message_end/runtime/agent_end events after --session resume and reload are recorded exactly once while true replay/re-delivery still dedups. Preserve Story 2 behavior for ordered fan-out, turn derivation, parallel tool correlation, tool error capture, graceful abort capture, runtime_note capture, and failure isolation. Add or update tests proving resume and reload against an existing thread capture new events after prior captures and do not silently drop them. Run pnpm --filter pi-lhc verify -- test/capture and pnpm --filter pi-lhc green-verify before returning.\\\"},\\\"selfNote\\\":\\\"Next planner turn should run verifier on the fresh implementor artifact, focused on SV-001 existing-thread resume/reload coverage and full Story 2 gates.\\\"}\"}}\ndocs/specs/02-pi-lhc/01-connector-core/artifacts/02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation/story-lead/progress/001-story-lead.status.json:1:{\"storyRunId\":\"02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation-story-run-001\",\"storyId\":\"02-event-capture-and-turn-derivation\",\"attempt\":1,\"status\":\"interrupted\",\"lifecycleState\":\"terminal\",\"currentSummary\":\"A bounded child operation failed before producing a us